  "title": "Zeroth axiom: experience exists",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "0d87cb75-1e2e-4f77-9be6-642c5915c36a",
      "text": "Experience exists: there is something. Doubting that one's experience exists is itself an experience, so the existence of experience is the starting point for everything, including logic and physics.",
